Package: ouistiti
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: ouistiti-utils
Description: lightweight and fast HTTP server for embedded devices
 Ouistiti is a small and fast HTTP server designed for embedded devices.
 It offers services like authentication (Basic, Digest, JWT, TOTP/MFA),
 websocket proxy, CGI, Python scripting, REST API on files, virtual hosting,
 CORS, TLS via OpenSSL or mbedTLS, and HTTP message signature (RFC 9421).

Package: ouistiti-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: devel
Depends: ouistiti (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: header files for ouistiti HTTP server
 Development headers and pkg-config file to build external modules
 for the ouistiti HTTP server.

Package: ouistiti-utils
Architecture: any
Section: net
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ouistiti (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: utilities and sample tools for ouistiti HTTP server
 Collection of utilities for ouistiti: websocket tools, password manager,
 TOTP URL generator, WebApp samples, and streaming tools.
